data/fall-cs.json.gz is an adapted synthetic course-timetabling research dataset
derived from the publicly provided Purdue Fall 2007 CS dataset:
https://www.unitime.org/uct_datasets.php
https://www.unitime.org/data/josh/pu-fal07-cs.zip

Source providers retain their rights. Consult the source provider for reuse terms
beyond this educational/research use. The source data was anonymized by its provider;
IDs retained here are benchmark IDs. Synthetic lab rooms, weekly lab requirements,
calendar and missing-instructor placeholders are assumptions, not source facts.
Detailed transformation provenance is in data/assumptions.json and provenance.json.

Pyodide is loaded from jsDelivr at runtime, not vendored into this repository.
It and the Python distribution retain their upstream licenses.
https://github.com/pyodide/pyodide

This app was implemented with assistance from OpenAI Codex. Method implementations,
decoder choices, constraints and limits are documented for review; using these tools
does not establish original research results or an institutional scheduling solution.
